WEBVTT

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:23.330
Hey, doesn't this count as peeping?

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.700
Shh! Keep quiet, and watch.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.410
Any second now...

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:36.620
Looking up girls' skirts
so early in the morning...

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:40.120
Nice hobby you have there, brats.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.000
S-Sorry!

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.290
Um, we were just picking up
some coins we dropped.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:52.040
If you were honest,
I was going to give you a free peek.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:54.040
R-Really?

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.540
What'll it be?

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:58.080
Are you going to be phonies?

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:00.410
Or honest boys?

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:01.500
A-Actually, we were--

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:05.250
Just kidding. Don't be so nervous!

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:08.620
A girl's panties are like a shooting star.

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:11.370
You only glimpse them by chance,
and therein lies the value.

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:15.950
Instead of looking down all the time,
raise your sights a little higher, boys.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:18.580
Raise our sights higher...

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:26.160
Goddesses do exist.

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:00.790
Super HXEROS!

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:03.000
Episode 7: XERO Game!

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:06.500
Lately in Saitama,

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:11.330
"RECORD-BREAKING OVERSLEEPING TREND"
companies and schools have reported
a sharp increase in the number of absences.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:14.910
Absent workers and students claim their dreams
were so fun that they were unable to wake up.

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:19.500
Employers and teachers
are looking for a swift solution.

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.160
Dreams?

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:26.120
"THE TEACHER ISN'T HERE YET,
BECAUSE SHE WOKE UP LATE!"

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:28.330
"THE TEACHER ISN'T HERE YET,
BECAUSE SHE WOKE UP LATE!"
The teacher woke up late?

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:32.160
Not just our teacher.

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:34.410
What the?!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.200
Could it be...

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:45.040
What? It's the same
at your school, Kirara?

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:48.950
Then, it's happening at all of our schools?

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:55.870
Everyone's saying it's fun, since they
get to have the dreams they want.

00:03:55.870 --> 00:04:00.450
And some people have even
been sleeping all day because of that.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:02.540
I have my suspicions.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:06.870
Someone with the ability
to show humans the dreams they desire,

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:12.700
making them escape from reality,
which in turns weakens all of humanity.

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:15.330
It may be the work of Genmuchuu.

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:21.830
I think this every time, but aren't
all of their abilities really roundabout?

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:27.660
Well, of course. Normally,
our race hopes for a peaceful invasion.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:33.040
But, with the Queen missing, the whole
organization is being poorly managed.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:37.290
I guess we'd better do something about it.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:39.500
Let's stop them as soon as possible.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.870
Agreed.

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:42.450
But to do that,

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:46.040
we need to gather
a lot of H-energy, right, Kirara?

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.410
H-Hey!

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:49.200
Oh, my!

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:52.580
Hey!

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.700
Chacha! Don't!

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:58.790
That's enough!

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:05.040
According to the map my uncle sent...

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:09.120
...this has to be it.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:13.700
It definitely looks like a place
where a Kiseichuu would lurk.

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:16.120
It's kind of creepy.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.290
Yeah.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:34.950
Nice to meet you. I'm Genmuchuu.

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:37.370
I've been waiting for you, HXEROS.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:41.250
And I see you there, too, former princess.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:46.870
You'll soon be disappointed in humans
and regret betraying us.

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:49.540
Skip the song and dance,
and come out!

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:53.040
We've got someone who's so filled with
H-energy that she's dying to do something!

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.120
Stop it!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.450
And what's with your voice?

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:59.660
Piping it into our heads
like you're so cool

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:02.370
when you've got a perfectly good intercom
you could use!

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:12.250
Fine! Then why don't we
get down to the battle?

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:14.540
What the?

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:17.700
An enemy exists within you.

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:21.870
The greatest enemy...
Desire!

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:36.160
Huh? I...

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.500
Ret!

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:40.040
Hoshino?

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:41.700
Knock it off, Ret!

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:45.370
We agreed to call each other
by our first names, remember?

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:47.580
D-Did we?

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:50.290
Jeez, how could you?

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:53.540
When we're dating...

00:06:57.410 --> 00:07:02.500
Okay, I'll give you a quiz,
and if you get it right, I'll forgive you.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:05.870
First, say "kiss" ten times.

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:07.080
That's not a quiz!

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:09.040
Just do it!

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.950
All right. Kiss, kiss,

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:16.500
kiss, kiss, kiss,

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.700
kiss, kiss.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:22.250
Okay, now the quiz.

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:28.290
What's the word that you say
before "kiss"?

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:31.370
H-How is that a quiz?

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:34.870
Look at me when you answer.

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:39.000
L-L-Love?

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:39.540
"SILLAGO"
"PERCIFORMES SILLAGINIDAE"

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:42.580
"SILLAGO"
"PERCIFORMES SILLAGINIDAE"
Bzzt! Sorry!
The correct answer is "sea perch"!

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:45.580
"[KISU] = SILLAGINIDAE FAMILY"
As in "sea perch, kisu family"!

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:49.080
Huh? You're blushing!

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:51.330
Did you have the wrong idea?

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:53.870
H-How would I have known that answer?

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:56.120
Okay, question number two.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:08:03.910
What am I going to do
that starts with K and ends with S?

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:11.250
I really do love her.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:16.000
But which me?

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.080
The me you're going out with now?

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:21.950
Or the me they call the Iron Maiden?

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:24.830
Or maybe me when I was your first love?

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:35.660
Or what about the regressed me?

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:37.870
Tell me.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:41.370
Which me do you love the most?

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:46.540
I'll do whatever you want, Ret,
mind and body.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.250
So choose!

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:54.500
The one I love is...

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.830
All of you.

00:08:56.830 --> 00:09:02.540
All of you here, all of the Hoshinos...

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:04.160
I love you!

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:09.000
That's right.
The you before changing, too.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.790
All of us? That's so stupid.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:15.450
The you after changing, too.

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:22.250
I dedicate the rest of my life
to all of these Kiraras.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:26.120
If this is a dream, don't wake me up!

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.830
Is this the place, Moena?

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:36.290
Yeah. I sense it,
the scent of a Kiseichuu.

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:37.910
Maybe two of them.

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:39.450
I see.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:50.580
I finally got through!

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:52.080
You...

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:55.950
Return to reality, and defeat Genmuchuu!

00:09:56.950 --> 00:10:01.450
No! I'm gonna provide for them
in this world!

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.870
Is that really all you want?

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.910
This is a world of your delusions, Retto.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:11.040
You can't experience anything more than
what you've seen or imagined thus far.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:14.120
But, if you defeat Genmuchuu,

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:19.410
I'll see to it that you have experiences
never even imagined with the real Kirara!

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.450
What if I promise that?

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:25.950
Is that valuable enough to make me
abandon this harem of Kiraras?

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:28.200
I promise you it is.

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:33.540
All right. How do I return?

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:36.370
Put this on, and pinch your cheek.

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:37.790
Got it.

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:42.290
Ret.

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:47.040
Make me happy over there, too.

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.040
I will!

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:54.410
It seems one of them
is about to wake up from the dream.

00:10:54.410 --> 00:10:56.370
I'd better use
a bit more hypno-sound waves.

00:10:56.370 --> 00:11:00.040
Are you the one
who's been causing that racket?

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:02.540
H-Humans?

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:05.500
Why isn't my hypnosis working on you?

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:12.540
Oh, I guess I did have a weird dream,
but it didn't do anything for me.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:17.950
But I'm sure you'll be much more stimulating
than some dream, right?

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:28.580
You're awake, Retto?

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:33.910
That's right. We came to defeat
the Kiseichuu, but then I got sleepy.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:36.950
What the?

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:38.750
It came from over there!

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.200
Hey, wake up!

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:41.910
It's no use.

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:45.950
You can only wake them by
entering their dreams or beating Genmuchuu.

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:49.410
Damn it! I'll be back!

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:59.120
Wh-Who are you two?

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:06.290
Shiko. There's one more Kiseichuu.

00:12:06.290 --> 00:12:07.870
That?

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.160
Wha?

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:14.910
What are you doing?

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:18.250
What? Exterminating, obviously!

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:22.790
This girl is one of us!

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:27.750
Now it makes sense. Are you guys
the HXEROS from Saitama Branch?

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:38.620
L-Let go of me!

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:41.080
This is all you've got?

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:46.790
You must think you're hot shit just
because you wiped out a Kiseichuu nest?

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:49.750
We're taking them with us.

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:50.750
See you.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:52.410
Not so fast!

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:55.160
I said she's one of us!

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.200
I meant to knock you out.

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:02.660
So, Saitama Branch has someone like you.

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:04.750
Interesting!

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:08.910
Certainly, this is on the border
between Tokyo and Saitama.

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:11.700
Who gets to claim this Kiseichuu
as the spoils?

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:15.830
Why don't we act like heroes
and have a duel to decide who's right?

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:20.120
I'm Shiko Murasame
with HXEROS, Tokyo Branch.

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:22.830
My silent partner over there
is Moena Wakakusa.

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:24.370
Nice to meet you.

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:26.620
The rules are simple.

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:31.540
Whoever feels H-energy first
and spews it out is the loser!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:37.950
I'm Genmuchuu.
And I've got you trapped in a dream world.

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:42.750
An H-energy showdown?

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:51.290
Hey, wh-what are you doing?

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:53.910
What am I doing? This is XERO game.

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:56.080
Whoever feels it first loses.

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:58.950
This is what you mean
by acting like heroes?

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:03.290
Oh, come on.
HXEROS do stuff like this on the daily.

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:06.870
Now quit relaxing, and move!

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.080
I can't move her?

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:16.370
Is the power of her XERO gear
increasing her physical ability?

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:18.620
Your head's finally in the game?

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:22.370
Then I have to counterattack?

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:31.700
No, I can't. I won't touch another girl
when I've got Hoshino!

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:34.540
Is your master a pacifist?

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:35.910
Ugh...

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:38.660
It's only a matter of time
before he loses.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:41.700
Shiko's switch has been turned on.

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:46.790
Kirara and the others train Retto
every single day, so this is nothing!

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:51.290
I-I can't take any more.

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:53.950
Oh, come on.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:56.950
Don't tell me you're surrendering.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:15:01.500
Saitama's HXEROS are a bunch of cowards!

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:10.370
Hoshino.

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:18.790
Say, Retto, tomorrow is your day off...

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:23.080
so why don't we put her to bed early
and, you know...

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:25.870
That's not gonna happen, old me.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:32.120
After all, Ret loves the me from this era!

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:37.290
N-No!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.160
A dream?

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:43.790
Everybody, wake up!

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:48.700
What? I was having a good dream.

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:52.370
Sheesh! Enjo, you wake up, too!

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:55.120
Huh? Enjo?

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:04.000
I give you props
for holding out this long.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:07.660
But it looks like you've hit your limit.

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:12.410
I guess he can't satisfy Shiko, either?

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:16.910
This is bad.
At this rate, Retto will... Retto will...

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:20.410
Don't you lose on me, Retto!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:22.950
Just don't!

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:28.040
What the?

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:29.790
Cut it out!

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:31.660
Let go of me!

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:41.290
HXEROS Beast Mode!

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:45.500
It worked!

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.700
What is this?

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:02.580
No! I can't take it!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:11.580
I'm sorry, Shiko. I was no match for him.

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:16.370
L-Looks like you're finally
taking this seriously.

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:19.870
It's like he's become another person!

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:27.160
But maybe he's the one
who can make me feel something.

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:35.370
Your body is extremely sensitive.
It's like one big erogenous zone.

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:38.040
But will I get better?

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:43.540
This is XERO gear. It's a device
that converts people's H-energy.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:49.160
If you use it in energy-guzzler mode and quickly
release the H-energy you've accumulated outside,

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:51.870
you should get relief from your symptom.

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:55.410
However, as a side effect,
your body will go the opposite way

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:57.540
and become extremely insensitive.

00:17:57.540 --> 00:18:01.450
Do you still want
to go through the treatment?

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:07.870
Because of this condition,
I'm afraid to touch other people.

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:12.120
But I want to touch them
just like my peers.

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:14.790
I want to feel someone else's warmth.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:18.830
Even if it means
it'll be difficult to feel anything,

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:22.000
better that than having dull emotions!

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:28.450
Ever since that day, I've fought
the Kiseichuu as a member of HXEROS.

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:32.040
Thanks to that, my symptom
of hypersensitivity has been cured,

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:37.290
but nothing and no one
has been able to stimulate me.

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:40.160
That's right. Until today...

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:46.040
I remember.
This body's burning sensation...

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:48.450
...the throbbing in my chest.

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:51.830
How long has it been?

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:56.290
All of the H-energy
I've accumulated up to now...

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.620
...all of it...

00:18:57.620 --> 00:19:00.330
I might as well spill it all out!

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:10.580
Huh? What happened?

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:17.500
Are you okay, Shiko?

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:20.580
Who would've figured
that both of us would lose?

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:23.830
I-I didn't let out a single drop!

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:26.000
What are you talking about?

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:30.000
I mean, I admit I lost,
but I didn't let everything out! Or...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:34.410
You were cute when you felt it,
but you're also cute when you're flustered.

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:37.200
Wh-What are you saying, dummy?

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:39.160
Hey, wait a second!

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:40.290
Yes?

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:42.660
What's your name?

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.200
Retto. Retto Enjo.

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:49.540
Good thing you got his name, right?

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:51.040
Shut up!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.330
Huh?

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:55.370
I smell one more Kiseichuu.

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:01.040
You weren't very thorough with my defeat!

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:01.870
--HXEROS without H-energy
are just normal humans!

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:05.200
--Shiko!
--HXEROS without H-energy
are just normal humans!

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:08.410
I'm going to put you to sleep
for eternity!

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:25.830
You really think you can get away from me?

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:31.000
Everyone!

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:32.700
Solar Ray!

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:34.410
Lamaze Cannon!

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.080
Wha?

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:55.250
Where are you touching me, jackass?

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:58.330
After what you did to me just before?

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.910
Are you okay, Enjo?

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:04.000
Yeah. Are you guys all right?

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:05.540
Who are those two?

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:09.330
They said they're
with the Tokyo Branch of HXEROS.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.200
Moena!

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:15.040
Momocchi!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.250
You know each other?

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:18.120
Yeah, same middle school.

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:22.290
But then I moved to Tokyo after being
accepted at a private high school.

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:25.750
Looks like you haven't changed, Momocchi.

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:27.450
Where are you looking?

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:32.950
So, what'll it be?
Do you still intend to steal Chacha?

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:36.700
Just so you know, we're not giving up!

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:40.580
I swear that one day,
my prey will be mine! Mark my words!

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:42.500
See you.

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:45.870
A formidable opponent
has you in her sights, Chacha.

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:47.200
Yeah.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:50.370
So what happened?

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:53.080
I don't really remember.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:57.370
But I have new respect for you, Retto,
after seeing you turn into a beast!

00:21:57.370 --> 00:21:59.410
You didn't need to mention that!

00:22:02.410 --> 00:22:06.410
I swear that one day,
my prey will be mine! Mark my words!

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:11.410
I was talking about you, Retto Enjo.

00:23:47.870 --> 00:23:49.500
Super HXEROS!

00:23:49.500 --> 00:23:51.910
Next time: H-energy Monster!
